                ],
                "github_reviewed": true,
                "github_reviewed_at": "2026-09-02T22:37:43Z",
                "nvd_published_at": "2026-08-25T22:17:04Z",
                "severity": "CRITICAL"
              },
              "details": "Improper Access Control, Incorrect Authorization vulnerability in Apache Tomcat leads to security constraint bypass if a constraint for a longer path is specified before a more restrictive constraint for a shorter sub-path.\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat: from 11.0.0-M1 through 11.0.24, from 10.1.0-M1 through 10.1.57, from 9.0.0.M1 through 9.0.120, from 8.5.0 through 8.5.100, from 7.0.0 through 7.0.109.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 11.0.25, 10.1.58, 9.0.121, which fixes the issue.",
              "id": "GHSA-gcx9-497g-6cp6",
              "modified": "2026-09-11T08:25:41.300012858Z",
              "published": "2026-08-26T00:30:52Z",
